%% Context: Product strategy map linking market choices to execution measures.
# Product Strategy
## Market Focus
- Ideal Customers
  - Mid-market operations teams
- Jobs to Be Done
  - Reduce manual coordination
## Product Bets
- Core Workflow
  - Faster approvals
- Differentiation
  - Explainable automation
## Go to Market
- Channels
  - Partner ecosystem
- Packaging
  - Usage-based tiers
## Success Measures
- Adoption
  - Weekly active teams
- Retention
  - Net revenue retention
